# 统一换行符，避免 Windows / macOS / Linux 互相改写整个文件
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须保持 CRLF，否则 cmd 解析可能出错
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# 图片与二进制文件不做换行符转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.zip binary
*.sqlite binary
